---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/brand/founders-note.png';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import { STORE_URL, CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../consts';
---

<Layout
	title="About Avora Matcha — Our Founders' Note"
	description="Avora Matcha was founded by Shruti and Elishia on one simple truth: matcha is for everyone. Ceremonial-grade matcha from first-harvest leaves in Kyoto and Kagoshima, Japan."
	pubDate={new Date('January 01 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		For many, matcha feels like a moment — a trend that travelled from Japan
		alongside Studio Ghibli films, anime, and a wave of cultural fascination.
		Beautiful, yes. But fleeting.
	</p>
	<p>For <strong>Shruti</strong>, matcha was never a trend. It was transformational.</p>

	<p>
		Shruti moves through life with the energy of a sprinter and the stamina of
		a marathon runner — driven by an internal fire and fuelled by big dreams. A
		certified yoga instructor, a software engineer, a model, and the founder of
		Sahai (a non-profit mental health organisation), she needed something that
		could keep up with her pace without slowing her down.
	</p>
	<p>
		Coffee made her jittery, followed by an inevitable crash. Tea was calming,
		but too gentle. And then came matcha. It met her exactly where she was: a
		steady rise, sustained energy, focus without frenzy, power without burnout.
		Cup after cup, it supported her active lifestyle, sharpened her mind, and
		grounded her body. Once it became part of her rhythm, it stayed.
	</p>

	<h2>Matcha deserved a place in everyday life</h2>
	<p>
		Shruti saw matcha not just as a drink, but as a quiet ally — one that could
		support a CEO powering through long days, a dancer moving through
		rehearsals, or anyone who cares about their health, energy, and inner
		balance. She believed matcha deserved a place in everyday life, without
		elitism and without stereotypes. That belief became <strong>Avora
		Matcha</strong>.
	</p>
	<p>
		Avora truly came alive when Shruti met a kindred spirit — <strong>Elishia
		</strong>. A marketer by day, a devoted matcha lover by heart, and an
		unwavering believer in Shruti's vision, Elishia joined as a partner on the
		journey.
	</p>

	<h2>Matcha is for everyone</h2>
	<p>
		Together, they built Avora on one simple truth: <strong>matcha is for
		everyone</strong>. No labels. No archetypes. Just the best quality matcha,
		meant to help you feel your best, live fully, and show up as yourself —
		whatever that looks like.
	</p>
	<p>
		We're so excited for you to try Avora — just really good matcha that gives
		you a high that lasts.
	</p>
	<p><em>With love &amp; matcha,<br />Shruti &amp; Elishia</em></p>

	<p>
		Ready to taste it? <a href={STORE_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Shop
		Avora Matcha</a>, or reach us any time at
		<a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
